The number of Americans living under the poverty line has continued to shrink for decades.

But what if the data is wrong?

@profplum99 explains why the real poverty line is actually $140,000 per year. https://t.co/juI21LCf99

@robustus @profplum99 @nic__carter If you go back and listen to this debate I did with him 4 years ago, it is even crazier.

